      "adaptations": [
        "Consolidated focused raw owned Bash builders; no upstream scope/stdenv import",
        "Linux6.9 from TVP; make headers ARCH=x86, explicit GCC16 CC/HOSTCC/CONFIG_SHELL/SHELL; public .h only and separate LICENSES",
