        "Bison explicit M4 and owned yacc shebang; installed skeletons retained",
        "TVP Python3.12.5 disabled-module profile and patch, NOT upstream Python3.14.6; explicit make SHELL for build/install and controlled compileall",
        "Installed Python/config script interpreters and config helper paths bound to owned outputs",
        "grep3.12 selected static.nix command logic, without a static linkage claim; egrep/fgrep bind shell and grep",
        "Native M4/Bison/grep check output preserves actual exit and logs, independently of functional contracts"
      ],
